{
  "id": "lesson.c1.17.02",
  "title": "The Accidental Se & Everyday Mishaps",
  "level": "C1",
  "goal": "Express everyday accidents without blame using accidental se + indirect object pronoun",
  "grammar": "accidental se + me/te/le/nos/les + 3rd-person agreement",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "goal",
      "items": [
        "I can form accidental *se* clauses with *se* before *me / te / le / nos / les*.",
        "I can match the verb in accidental *se* to the singular or plural thing affected.",
        "I can use everyday mishap vocabulary like *derramarse*, *quemarse*, *echarse a perder* and *el despiste*."
      ]
